        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ulli Lommel, Benjamin Stoloff\n- Places: USA, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, Hollywood, California\n- Products: Absolute Evil – Final Exit, Two in the Dark\n- Roles: film director, producer, writer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Benjamin Stoloff was born on October 6, 1895, in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.\n- Benjamin Stoloff was an American film director and producer.\n- Benjamin Stoloff directed the film Two in the Dark, a movie about an amnesiac suspected of murder.\n- Since 1977, Ulli Lommel has lived and worked in the USA.\n- In the USA, Ulli Lommel has written, directed, and starred in over 50 movies.\n- Ulli Lommel wrote and directed the drama film Absolute Evil – Final Exit.\n- Benjamin Stoloff died on September 8, 1960, in Hollywood, California.",
